   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HEFActivations - 2025(12) - Afghanistan Earthquake - Tearfund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aimed to support people affected by the humanitarian crisis in Afghanistan following two major earthquakes in 2025. Through Scotland&#x2019;s Humanitarian Emergency Fund (HEF), funding enabled Tearfund to provide essential assistance, including cash support, warm blankets and clothing, and hygiene kits to those living in earthquake-affected areas, helping them endure harsh winter conditions. In addition, the funding delivered psychological support to individuals most severely impacted, addressing both immediate needs and longer-term wellbeing.</narrative>
  </description>
